WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:03.558
Unit twelve. Clean Water and Diarrhea!

2
00:00:04.508 --> 00:00:08.526
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.576 --> 00:00:12.258
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.308 --> 00:00:16.583
Today we learn about Clean Water and Diarrhea. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.297 --> 00:00:21.214
Diarrhea. Say it with me. Diarrhea!

6
00:00:24.671 --> 00:00:28.571
Clean water. Say it with me. Clean water!

7
00:00:32.074 --> 00:00:35.341
Boil. Say it with me. Boil!

8
00:00:38.837 --> 00:00:42.371
Toilet. Say it with me. Toilet!

9
00:00:45.872 --> 00:00:49.572
Handwashing. Say it with me. Handwashing!

10
00:00:53.097 --> 00:00:56.563
Germs. Say it with me. Germs!

11
00:01:00.065 --> 00:01:03.132
Drink. Say it with me. Drink!

12
00:01:06.638 --> 00:01:09.972
Doctor. Say it with me. Doctor!

13
00:01:13.462 --> 00:01:23.868
Dirty water and dirty hands can cause diarrhea. We drink clean water that is boiled or filtered, use a toilet, and practise handwashing. If diarrhea lasts, we see a doctor.

14
00:01:23.918 --> 00:01:25.158
I can do that too!

15
00:01:26.489 --> 00:01:31.669
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:31.719 --> 00:01:32.869
Boil!

17
00:01:33.699 --> 00:01:38.823
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:38.873 --> 00:01:40.000
Drink!

19
00:01:40.693 --> 00:01:47.881
Did you know? A sick person with diarrhea needs to drink plenty of safe fluids to replace lost water!

20
00:01:47.931 --> 00:01:50.050
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:50.748 --> 00:01:58.654
Think and answer. How can your family make water safe to drink?

22
00:01:58.704 --> 00:01:59.854
Great answer!

23
00:02:00.902 --> 00:02:05.545
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:05.595 --> 00:02:08.183
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

